{
  "title": "Activity and POI",
  "description": "Web component to show South Tyrol activities and points of interest on a map. Categories come from the ODH Tag API; results are filtered with tagfilter. Search by text and browse details for each marker.",
  "descriptionAbstract": "A web component to show activities and point of interests of South Tyrol.",
